{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 121, "line_no": 22, "text": "动物为祭品，称“可考都兴”（k‘ou”k'ao”tu\"zin”），其意为“吃九种牲畜的神”。", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 1485, "w": 1383, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "动物为祭品，称“可考都兴”（k‘ou”k'ao”tu\"zin”），其意为“吃九种牲畜的神”。", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 1485, "w": 1383, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
